      "canonical_latex": "k^\\mu = (m,0,0,0) \\implies H_k = \\mathrm{SO}(3) \\xrightarrow{\\text{被覆}} \\mathrm{SU}(2),\\quad \\hat{\\mathbf{J}}^2|k,s,\\sigma\\rangle = s(s+1)|k,s,\\sigma\\rangle,\\quad \\sigma = -s,\\dots,s",
